  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundary facts",
      "items": [
        "CORS allowlists CLIENT_URL, localhost, and *.vercel.app; Helmet is enabled; trust proxy is on for cookies.",
        "Taste initialize and ranked recs use optionalProtect (guest sessionId still accepted). Matching, DMs, and safety use protect; admin routes add adminOnly.",
        "Tokens are set httpOnly with SameSite=None in production; the SPA also sends Authorization: Bearer from localStorage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What the rec path reads",
      "items": [
        "GET /api/recommendations/ranked loads UserTasteProfile then scores MovieProfile embeddings with cosine similarity (65%) plus tag overlap (35%).",
        "Candidate replenishment calls TMDB /discover and /recommendations in the background; Atlas $vectorSearch is used for similar-movie lookup with in-memory fallback.",
        "UserTasteProfile.findOneAndUpdate in tasteClusterService persists clusters, globalCentroid, and aiSynthesis on the same Atlas cluster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Secondary product surfaces",
      "items": [
        "Cinephile Twin matching is JWT-gated and rate-limited; cosine similarity runs on globalCentroid / cluster centroids.",
        "Conversations require protect and poll for messages. Block, report, and admin ban live under /api/safety and /api/users.",
        "Gmail SMTP (smtp.gmail.com:465) sends OTP and suspension mail. Nginx, Certbot, and EC2 appear in README, not as in-repo runtime units."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Provider fallbacks",
      "items": [
        "Clustering tries DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Gemini, then OpenAI, then a local heuristic partition if every client fails or times out (AI_TIMEOUT_MS, default 10s).",
        "Fast-path movie profiling writes a 768-d heuristic embedding and may enrich via analyzeFilm / createEmbedding in the background.",
        "Evidence is pinned to commit ab49804a; server/services/aiService.js has local uncommitted edits that are not cited as HEAD behavior."
      ]
    }
  ]
